{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>專注力不足/過度活躍症(ADHD)患者，在不同場所可以判若兩人。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_EUNICE_HIGHLIGHT.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026A15esuCYxK1791639596.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>黃曉瑩稱：「你真專注，完全不像專注力失調。」</p><p></p><p>王玉珍回應：「我已忘了你的存在。」</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_EUNICE_HIGHLIGHT_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026CNQ3FzR77W1791639617.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>離開房間，果然打回原形。</p><p></p><p>王玉珍說：「方東昇，你叫『汪』東昇、你「汪」曉瑩。就這樣叫嘉嘉，沒有減減。你叫甚麼名字？」</p><p></p><p>黃曉瑩回答：「我叫黃曉瑩。」</p><p></p><p>王玉珍笑稱：「我們同姓，三劃『王』。」</p><p></p><p>黃曉瑩表示：「不是，我是黃色的『黃』。」</p><p></p><p>王玉珍轉身離開。</p><p></p><p></p><p>【醫生簡介】</p><p></p><p><strong>王玉珍</strong></p><p><strong>美國加州執照兒科醫生</strong></p><p><strong>專攻專注力失調及過度活躍症(ADHD)</strong></p><p></p><ul><li><p>26歲在香港讀護士</p></li><li><p>35歲去美國讀醫</p></li><li><p>專注力促進會創會主席</p></li></ul></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T08:02:06.077534+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":269,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T07:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T08:27:57.961902+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T07:58:24.863418+00:00","content_hash":"7d466011f0e8dfb9f489237946f9b4db0ccbfbed7d5ddd0617ab2a25e8f85cfa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}